    <item>
      <title>DNS Resolution Problem at start on Apple M2</title>
      <link>https://idea0816.github.io/2024/02/01/dns-resolution-problem-at-start/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 01 Feb 2024 19:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://idea0816.github.io/2024/02/01/dns-resolution-problem-at-start/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;最近把 Spring Boot 升級到 3.2.1 後、莫名的遇到了以下的警告：&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Unable to load io.netty.resolver.dns.macos.MacOSDnsServerAddressStreamProvider, fallback to system defaults. This may result in incorrect DNS resolutions on MacOS. Check whether you have a dependency on &amp;#39;io.netty:netty-resolver-dns-native-macos&amp;#39;. Use DEBUG level to see the full stack: java.lang.UnsatisfiedLinkError: failed to load the required native library&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;經查：應該是因為在使用 M 晶片的 macOS 上缺了系統需要的 Library。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
